#: ../../development.rst:2
msgid "Development and publishing"
msgstr "开发与发布"

#: ../../development.rst:5
msgid "Verification"
msgstr "验证"

#: ../../development.rst:18
msgid ""
"Maintain the nanobind C++ bindings in ``src/bindings/`` and the compatible Python "
"facades in ``src/pymarvin/`` directly. Update their English docstrings in place. "
"Maintain the required Apache-2.0 SDK sources in ``src/sdk/control/``, "
"``src/sdk/kinematics/`` and ``src/sdk/interference/``. Tests check the SDK headers "
"against the installed extensions; reference copies and obsolete SDKs are not part of "
"the project."
msgstr ""
"直接维护 ``src/bindings/`` 中的 nanobind C++ 绑定和 ``src/pymarvin/`` 中的兼容 Python "
"接口，并在原处更新英文文档字符串。所需的 Apache-2.0 SDK 源码位于 ``src/sdk/control/``、``src/sdk/kinematics/``"
" 和 ``src/sdk/interference/``。测试会检查 SDK 头文件与已安装扩展的一致性；项目不包含参考副本和旧版 SDK。"

#: ../../development.rst:24
msgid ""
"The bundled SDK snapshot is pinned to commit "
"``bc4f61104a66e82b4c750f3a0bc7a95c9ef44139`` from the official "
"`TJ_FX_ROBOT_CONTRL_SDK repository <https://github.com/cynthia-"
"you/TJ_FX_ROBOT_CONTRL_SDK>`_."
msgstr ""
"随包 SDK 快照固定为官方 ``TJ_FX_ROBOT_CONTRL_SDK`` 仓库的提交 "
"``bc4f61104a66e82b4c750f3a0bc7a95c9ef44139``。"

#: ../../development.rst:29
msgid "English and Chinese documentation"
msgstr "英文与中文文档"

#: ../../development.rst:31
msgid ""
"``docs/_ext/generate_api.py`` inspects the installed package exports, validates "
"public docstrings and generates the API index when Sphinx loads ``docs/conf.py``. "
"Generated API pages are excluded from version control and source distributions. CI "
"invokes Sphinx and the translation checker directly."
msgstr ""
"``docs/_ext/generate_api.py`` 会检查已安装包的公开导出和文档字符串，并在 Sphinx 加载 ``docs/conf.py`` 时生成 API 索引。"
"自动生成的 API 页面不会纳入版本控制和源码包。CI 会直接运行 Sphinx 和翻译检查器。"

#: ../../development.rst:36
msgid ""
"English reStructuredText and API docstrings are the source language. Chinese "
"translations live in ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po``. The catalog checker "
"rejects missing, untranslated, fuzzy, stale and invalid entries."
msgstr ""
"英文 reStructuredText 和 API 文档字符串为源语言，中文翻译位于 ``docs/locale/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES/*.po`` "
"；目录检查器会拒绝缺失、未翻译、模糊、过期或无效的条目。"

#: ../../development.rst:47
msgid ""
"After editing source text, run the catalog checker with ``--update``, translate the "
"new entries, and rerun the check without that option. Each documentation page links "
"to the same page in the other language."
msgstr "修改源文本后，先使用 ``--update`` 选项运行目录检查器，翻译新增条目，再去掉该选项重新检查。每个文档页面均可链接至另一种语言的对应页面。"

#: ../../development.rst:52
msgid "Read the Docs setup"
msgstr "Read the Docs 配置"

#: ../../development.rst:54
msgid ""
"Import ``https://github.com/slabpanic/pymarvin`` into Read the Docs as project "
"``pymarvin``, select English as its language, use ``main`` as the default branch, and"
" select ``.readthedocs.yaml`` as the configuration file. Enable the repository's Read"
" the Docs Git integration to build documentation when changes are pushed."
msgstr ""
"在 Read the Docs 中将 ``https://github.com/slabpanic/pymarvin`` 导入为 ``pymarvin`` "
"项目，语言选择英语，默认分支设为 ``main``，配置文件选择 ``.readthedocs.yaml``。启用仓库的 Read the Docs Git "
"集成，以便推送更改时自动构建文档。"

#: ../../development.rst:59
msgid ""
"For Simplified Chinese, import the same repository as a second project, for example "
"``pymarvin-zh-cn``, select Simplified Chinese as its language, and add it under the "
"parent project's Translations settings. Both projects use the same configuration and "
"gettext catalogs. Read the Docs supplies the selected language and version; Sphinx "
"uses them for translated pages, canonical URLs and language-switch links."
msgstr ""
"简体中文需要将同一仓库导入为另一个项目，例如 ``pymarvin-zh-cn``，语言选择简体中文，并在主项目的 Translations "
"设置中添加它。两个项目共用配置文件和 gettext 翻译目录。Read the Docs 提供当前语言与版本，Sphinx 据此生成翻译页面、规范网址和语言切换链接。"

#: ../../development.rst:65
msgid ""
"The public URLs are ``https://pymarvin.readthedocs.io/en/latest/`` and "
"``https://pymarvin.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/``. CI independently checks both "
"languages and uploads available HTML previews even if a documentation build fails. "
"Read the Docs performs the hosted build using the repository configuration."
msgstr ""
"公开文档地址为 ``https://pymarvin.readthedocs.io/en/latest/`` 和 "
"``https://pymarvin.readthedocs.io/zh-cn/latest/``。CI 独立检查两种语言，即使文档构建失败也会上传已经生成的 HTML "
"预览。Read the Docs 根据仓库配置执行线上文档构建。"

#: ../../development.rst:71
msgid "PyPI Trusted Publishing setup"
msgstr "PyPI 信任发布设置"

#: ../../development.rst:73
msgid ""
"Create a PyPI Trusted Publisher (or pending publisher for a new project) with owner "
"``slabpanic``, repository ``pymarvin``, workflow ``release.yml`` and environment "
"``pypi``. Create the matching GitHub environment. No long-lived PyPI API token is "
"used."
msgstr ""
"创建 PyPI 信任发布者，首次新项目可使用待定发布者；填写所有者 ``slabpanic`` 、仓库 ``pymarvin`` 、工作流 ``release.yml``"
" 和环境 ``pypi`` ，并在 GitHub 创建同名环境。不使用长期 PyPI API token。"

#: ../../development.rst:77
msgid ""
"Set the normalized project version, update ``uv.lock``, and push a matching "
"``vX.Y.Z`` tag when ready to publish. ``release.yml`` calls the reusable ``ci.yml`` "
"workflow, which validates the tag, builds and verifies one source archive, runs tests"
" and coverage, validates bilingual documentation, and builds, repairs and tests all "
"15 CPython 3.10–3.14 wheels for Linux x86_64/aarch64 and Windows x64."
msgstr ""
"准备发布时，设置规范化的项目版本、更新 ``uv.lock``，并推送匹配的 ``vX.Y.Z`` 标签。``release.yml`` 调用可复用的 "
"``ci.yml`` 工作流，统一校验标签、构建并验证一份源码归档、执行测试与覆盖率检查、校验双语文档，并构建、修复和测试 Linux x86_64/aarch64 及 "
"Windows x64 上 CPython 3.10–3.14 的全部 15 个 wheel。"

#: ../../development.rst:83
msgid ""
"CI collects the source archive and wheels, verifies the complete set with "
"``check_wheels.py`` and Twine, and uploads the ``pymarvin-dist`` artifact. After CI "
"succeeds, the release job downloads that artifact and runs ``uv publish --trusted-"
"publishing always dist/*`` without rebuilding packages. macOS is excluded. CI "
"validates documentation while Read the Docs handles hosting."
msgstr ""
"CI 汇总源码归档和 wheel，通过 ``check_wheels.py`` 与 Twine 校验完整产物集合，再上传 ``pymarvin-dist`` 产物。CI "
"成功后，发布任务下载该产物并运行 ``uv publish --trusted-publishing always dist/*``，不重复构建包。不包含 "
"macOS。CI 负责文档校验，Read the Docs 负责文档托管。"

#: ../../development.rst:89
msgid ""
"Do not recreate an existing PyPI version. Correct a failed release in a new version "
"when an archive has already been accepted by the registry. Configuring this workflow "
"does not publish a release until a matching tag is pushed."
msgstr "不要重新创建已有 PyPI 版本；若仓库已接受归档，失败发布应通过新版本修正。配置工作流不会立即发布版本，只有推送匹配的标签后才会触发。"

#: ../../development.rst:94
msgid "Codecov and native coverage"
msgstr "Codecov 与原生覆盖率"

#: ../../development.rst:96
msgid ""
"Enable ``slabpanic/pymarvin`` in Codecov and allow GitHub OIDC uploads. The coverage "
"job requests ``id-token: write`` and sends separate ``python`` and ``native`` flags. "
"Fork PRs still generate coverage artifacts but do not upload with repository "
"identity."
msgstr ""
"在 Codecov 启用 ``slabpanic/pymarvin`` 并允许 GitHub OIDC 上传。覆盖率任务请求 ``id-token: write`` "
"权限，并分别发送 ``python`` 与 ``native`` 标志。Fork PR 仍会生成覆盖率产物，但不使用仓库身份上传。"

#: ../../development.rst:110
msgid ""
"If a workstation has unrelated pytest plugins on PYTHONPATH, set "
"``PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1``. CI sets this explicitly. Coverage thresholds "
"are enforced in CI: 95 percent combined Python statement/branch coverage and 75 "
"percent native line coverage. Codecov compares each flag against its base commit with"
" a 1 percent tolerance; its treatment of partially covered branches differs from the "
"line metric. Uncovered controller-dependent paths remain in the reports."
msgstr ""
"如果工作站的 PYTHONPATH 中存在无关 pytest 插件，请设置 ``PYTEST_DISABLE_PLUGIN_AUTOLOAD=1`` ；CI "
"已显式设置此变量。CI 强制要求 Python 语句与分支综合覆盖率至少为 95%，原生代码行覆盖率至少为 75%。Codecov 将每个标记与基准提交比较，允许 1% "
"的差异；它对部分覆盖分支的处理与行覆盖率指标不同。需要控制器的未覆盖路径仍保留在报告中。"

#: ../../development.rst:117
msgid ""
"Test execution, Python reporting and native reporting use separate CI steps. Both "
"reporting steps run with ``if: always()`` so failures retain diagnostic reports; the "
"original test failure still fails CI. Codecov uploads run only after successful "
"checks and use ``plugins: noop`` to upload the explicitly generated XML files."
msgstr ""
"测试执行、Python 覆盖率报告和原生覆盖率报告使用独立的 CI 步骤。两个报告步骤均设置 ``if: "
"always()``，使失败后仍能保留诊断报告；原始测试失败仍会使 CI 失败。Codecov 仅在检查成功后上传，并通过 ``plugins: noop`` "
"关闭插件，仅上传显式生成的 XML 文件。"

